WEBVTT

00:12:59.817 --> 00:13:02.986
But unlike spouses, you don't become
a social welfare state of two,

00:13:02.986 --> 00:13:04.446
which can be a good thing.

00:13:04.988 --> 00:13:08.116
I had a client who had
a severely disabled sister.

00:13:09.076 --> 00:13:11.328
By becoming domestic partners,

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:12.871
she was able to put her sister

00:13:12.871 --> 00:13:15.666
on her excellent
health insurance coverage.

00:13:15.666 --> 00:13:18.877
Why would a sister be any less worthy
of that than a boyfriend?

00:13:20.087 --> 00:13:21.296
Right?

00:13:22.089 --> 00:13:23.257
Thank you.

00:13:23.298 --> 00:13:24.550
(Applause)

00:13:24.591 --> 00:13:26.260
We've built on that history.

00:13:27.553 --> 00:13:32.099
In 2020, my organization
helped pass the first laws